@baseUrl = http://localhost:5080
@token = PEGA_AQUI_EL_ACCESS_TOKEN

### Alta de jugador
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "pelayo@example.com",
  "password": "Password123",
  "displayName": "Pelayo Fernández",
  "position": "Forward",
  "birthDate": "1998-04-12"
}

### Login
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "pelayo@example.com",
  "password": "Password123"
}

### Mi perfil
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/players/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Equipos de la temporada
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/teams

### Ficha de un equipo (plantilla scrapeada + jugadores registrados)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/teams/{{teamId}}

### Unirse a un equipo reclamando una ficha de la plantilla
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/players/me/team
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "teamId": "{{teamId}}",
  "rosterEntryId": "{{rosterEntryId}}",
  "shirtNumber": 9
}

### Partidos de mi equipo
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/teams/{{teamId}}/matches
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Registrar rendimiento en un partido disputado
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/matches/{{matchId}}/performance
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "started": true,
  "minutesPlayed": 90,
  "goals": 1,
  "assists": 1,
  "shots": 4,
  "shotsOnTarget": 2,
  "keyPasses": 2,
  "tackles": 1,
  "interceptions": 0,
  "saves": 0,
  "yellowCards": 0,
  "redCard": false,
  "selfRating": 8,
  "notes": "Buen partido, marqué de cabeza."
}

### Panel del jugador
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/stats/dashboard
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Clasificación
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/league/table

### Forzar sincronización con el proveedor
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/sync
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
